{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"第一章：行为经济学基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论与价值函数：行为经济学的核心模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/prospect-theory","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounded-rationality","title":"有限理性与生态理性：人脑的决策经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/bounded-rationality","wordCount":1873,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"heuristics-and-biases","title":"启发式与认知偏误：系统化的判断偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics-applications/foundations/heuristics-and-biases","wordCount":2018,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第一章-行为经济学基础理论\">第一章：行为经济学基础理论</h1><p>本章构建行为经济学的理论地基：为什么人会系统性地偏离理性决策，偏离的模式是什么，以及这些模式能否被预测和建模。三篇文档分别对应三个知识节点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>前景理论</strong>（Prospect Theory）— Kahneman/Tversky 的核心贡献，用价值函数和概率权重函数取代期望效用理论</li>\n<li><strong>有限理性</strong>（Bounded Rationality）— Simon 的框架与 Gigerenzer 的生态理性，解释人脑为何选择&quot;够好&quot;而非&quot;最优&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>启发式与偏误</strong>（Heuristics and Biases）— 代表性、可得性、锚定三大启发式，以及它们在现实中产生的系统误差</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"本章与后续章节的关系\">本章与后续章节的关系</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"第 1 章（为什么偏离）&#10;    ↓&#10;第 2 章（如何利用偏离设计助推）&#10;    ↓&#10;第 3 章（在产品/政策中落地）&#10;    ↓&#10;第 4 章（用实验验证效果）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>第 1 章（为什么偏离）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第 2 章（如何利用偏离设计助推）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第 3 章（在产品/政策中落地）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第 4 章（用实验验证效果）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>理解偏误的认知根源，是设计有效干预的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章三篇文档\">本章三篇文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"prospect-theory\">前景理论与价值函数</a>：损失厌恶、参考点依赖、概率权重</li>\n<li><a href=\"bounded-rationality\">有限理性与生态理性</a>：Simon 的满意准则、Gigerenzer 的快速节俭启发式</li>\n<li><a href=\"heuristics-and-biases\">启发式与认知偏误</a>：代表性、可得性、锚定，以及组合式偏误</li>\n</ul>\n"}